00:06:27.779 --> 00:06:31.979
the explosive, or the energetic
material will will detonate and

00:06:31.979 --> 00:06:34.139
below the curve, it will not
detonate. So it's the

00:06:34.139 --> 00:06:37.619
criticality curve. And you can
